Interlingua
A PaperPaw plugin, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (LICENSE).

Parts of it are taken from PaperPaw (https://github.com/hthoene/paperpaw),
Copyright 2026 Hannes Thoene and the PaperPaw contributors, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0, and changed:

- crates/interlingua/src/lib.rs and tests/interlingua.rs,
  from samples/interlinear;
- build.sh, paperpaw-plugin.x, .cargo/config.toml, rust-toolchain.toml and
  src/main.rs, from samples/hello-native;
- .github/workflows/, from tools/dev/templates.

The idea of the sentence alignment in crates/interlingua/src/pairing.rs
comes from CrossLingua Reader (https://github.com/ed-fruty/crosslingua-reader,
MIT License); none of its code is here.

crates/interlingua/tests/books/alice-in-wonderland.txt is a Project
Gutenberg eBook, under the Project Gutenberg License at its end. It is used
by the tests only and never goes onto a reader.
